# CHECK: [[whole]]: int[2, 3] {{*}} = CallInline {{*}}inlineBuiltin=MathTrunc
# RUN(CONSTANTS): walk f1 mechanisms=none+TypedOperations+Folding+DirectCalls+BuiltinCalls
# CONSTANTS-LABEL: code f1:Body
# CONSTANTS: : fractional[2, 3] {{*}} = Double number=2.3333333333333335
# With Folding withheld the quotient is built, and has the type of its row.
